; Curated moveset corpus for MSRC_SET, generated by tools/gen_movesets.py.
; NOT wired into `make` - re-run by hand and commit the output, the same
; tools/gen_event_constants.py / tools/reorder_move_ranks.py arrangement.
;
; Source corpus: 1946 records. Kept 1816, dropped 130:
;   31 named a species absent from this tree entirely
;     (14 distinct: CLEFFA, DELIBIRD, ELEKID, HAPPINY, IGGLYBUFF, MAGBY, MIME_JR, MUNCHLAX, PICHU, SMEARGLE, SMOOCHUM, TYROGUE, UNOWN, WOBBUFFET)
;   99 named a regional/eeveelution FORM - dropped rather than
;     merged into the base species (see this script's module docstring: the 8-byte
;     record has no form field, and a form's moveset can be illegal for its base)
;   0 named a move absent from this tree (after PSYCHIC->PSYCHIC_M: [])
; Defaulted rather than dropped: 32 records had no tier rating (-> TIER_NORMAL),
;   32 had no level range (-> 1-100), 2 had an inverted range (swapped).

SECTION "Movesets Index", ROMX, BANK[$3D]

MovesetOriginNames::
	table_width 2, MovesetOriginNames
	dw .origin0
	dw .origin1
	dw .origin2
	dw .origin3
	dw .origin4
	dw .origin5
	dw .origin6
	dw .origin7
	dw .origin8
	dw .origin9
	dw .origin10
	dw .origin11
	dw .origin12
	dw .origin13
	dw .origin14
	dw .origin15
	assert_table_length 16
.origin0: db "You lost to a competitive reference set.", 0
.origin1: db "an old team someone once ran", 0
.origin2: db "You lost to a sourced Red/Blue-era set.", 0
.origin3: db "You lost to a historical RBY team build.", 0
.origin4: db "You lost to a sample-team set.", 0
.origin5: db "You lost to a tournament set.", 0
.origin6: db "You lost to Amaranth's Global Championships team.", 0
.origin7: db "You lost to Ctown6's RBY Ubers Tournament 2022 Team Dump set.", 0
.origin8: db "You lost to a RBY Ubers Tournament 2022 Team Dump set.", 0
.origin9: db "You lost to a RBY Ubers Hub 2021 set.", 0
.origin10: db "You lost to Texas Cloverleaf's RBY Cup X Round 2 Game 3 set.", 0
.origin11: db "You got caught by an RBY OU community gimmick.", 0
.origin12: db "You lost to Amaranth's SPL X team.", 0
.origin13: db "You lost to a modern RBY analysis set.", 0
.origin14: db "You lost to a Red Rogue original set.", 0
.origin15: db "You lost to a GSC-inspired Red Rogue set.", 0

; One record per curated set: db move1, move2, move3, move4, tier, origin_id,
; lvl_min, lvl_max. Species is NOT stored per-record - it is implied by which
; species' run of records this is, addressed via MovesetSpeciesIndex.
DEF MOVESET_RECORD_SIZE EQU 8

SECTION "Movesets 1", ROMX, BANK[$3A]

